OL,3,GNEWSAIt's going to be our last         
OL,4,AChristmas with him - we wanted it to be
OL,5,Aspecial                                
OL,7,FThe family of a man with terminal brain
OL,8,Fcancer have organised an early         
OL,9,FChristmas to make sure they were all   
OL,10,Fable to enjoy one last one together.   
OL,12,FGary Lowe, 58, spent 14 November       
OL,13,Fsurrounded by his children and         
OL,14,Fgrandchildren, who threw the festive   
OL,15,Fevent at his home in Thurmaston,       
OL,16,FLeicestershire, due to his prognosis.  
OL,18,FGary was diagnosed with brain cancer   
OL,19,Fand underwent surgery in 2024, which   
OL,20,Fsaw a tumour and part of his skull     
OL,21,Fremoved, but in January he was told his
OL,22,Fcondition was terminal.                
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
