OL,3,GNEWSAIt's going to be our last         
OL,4,AChristmas with him - we wanted it to be
OL,5,Aspecial                                
OL,7,F"I love them all, and I don't know if  
OL,8,FI'll be here over Christmas," he said. 
OL,9,F"We know what's going to happen, but we
OL,10,Fdon't know when."                      
